          "evidence": "The zero-dimensional instances are separated in steps 2.1 and 8.2: $S_A$ is defined on $M(A)$ even when $M(A)=0$ by step 2.1, and step 8.2 factors $A$ as the empty product exactly in the case $M(A)=0$, where $A=\\mathrm{id}$."
        },
        {
