          "evidence": "No selection occurs: step 3.1 defines $S_A$ and step 5.1 defines $H_U$ as the unique operators satisfying their displayed identities, and step 9.1 records the inverse $B\\mapsto M(B)$ of the assignment; uniqueness is proved, so the Choice axis is discharged by uniqueness rather than assumed."
        },
