          "evidence": "The forward direction of the reflection clause holds by step 2.2: an $A\\in\\mathrm O(V)$ with $\\dim M(A)=1$ is shown to equal $\\mathrm{id}-2\\Pi_L$ on the line $L=M(A)$; the forward direction of the prefix clause of (5) is step 10.1, which exhibits $B$ as the length-$k$ prefix of a shortest factorization of $A$."
        },
