          "evidence": "The reverse direction of the reflection clause is also step 2.2 ($\\mathrm{id}-2\\Pi_L$ is an orthogonal reflection with moved space $L$), and the reverse direction of the prefix clause of (5) is step 9.2, where a prefix $B=r_1\\cdots r_k$ of a shortest factorization is shown to satisfy the rank identity $B\\le_{\\mathrm O}A$."
