          "evidence": "The value $\\ell_T=1$ is read off in step 2.1 for every transposition, including the long transposition $(1\\ 5)$ of clause (ii); step 1.1 shows that these are exactly the reflections $T$, so the unit of reflection length is the transposition case."
        },
        {
          "case": "degenerate",
