          "case": "endpoints",
          "status": "checked",
          "evidence": "The transposition $(i\\ j)$ has the two endpoints $j=i+1$ (adjacent, $\\ell=1$) and $(i,j)=(1,5)$ (long, $\\ell=7$); step 1.2 computes the general value $2(j-i)-1$ and step 3.1 applies it to $(1\\ 5)$, while the reversal $(1\\ 5)(2\\ 4)$ attains the maximum inversion number $10$."
